   "customData": {
    "author": "agent",
    "kind": "transform",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "Combines everything into the one thing the dashboard and the reports both read from.\n\n**Not drawn, but real:** a fifth source, the **Macro Calendar** (Fed dates, CPI prints), is still wired in as a config option and fed straight into this box, bypassing the Cutoff and enrichment. It is **off by default** as of Aug 2026 — mostly noise outside Fed weeks — and deliberately left off this drawing to keep the flow readable.\n\nIf someone re-ticks it on the console, this is where it lands."
   },
